License Texts
-------------
Verbatim license files copied from each upstream repository at its
pinned commit are in third_party_licenses/upstream/<repo_id>/, keeping
the upstream relative path (seven of the repositories ship more than one
LICENSE file, so the path matters).

The SPDX texts that the REUSE tooling reads are in LICENSES/:
MIT.txt for our code, CC-BY-4.0.txt for our metadata, and one file per
upstream license expression used above.
